        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCCOV, Coventry Black Glass Knob With Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black Coventry Knobset with Arc Rose has a very classic look, one that harkens back to the Roaring 20's. This retro knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of complimentary finish colors. The Coventry Black Glass Knob With Arched Rose will  fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCCOV Arc Rosette with Coventry Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Black Glass Coventry Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCCOV-specifications.pdf?v=1704262365\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCCOV Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
