                "description": "The Black Coventry Knobset with Arc Rose has a very classic look, one that harkens back to the Roaring 20's. This retro knobset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of complimentary finish colors. The Coventry Black Glass Knob With Arched Rose will  fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
